ooks","material","fits","quality","weight","style","issues","delivery","pockets","finish","colour","design","value","light","feels","construction","lining","protection","move","strap","simplicity","details","case","shade","build","dimensions","suitcase","threads","wheels"].</p>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-highlights">     <h3>Review highlights</h3>     <ul>       <li><span class="yotpo-highlight-text">"The size is spacious yet compact, wheels roll smoothly, and the whole thing looks and feels such good quality."</span> — <span class="yotpo-highlight-author">Amanda J.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-highlight-text">"The wheels roll smoothly, the handle feels sturdy, and the interior is well organised, making packing much easier."</span> — <span class="yotpo-highlight-author">Ash M.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-highlight-text">"The wheels glide effortlessly, even on uneven surfaces, and the handle feels solid and comfortable to use."</span> — <span class="yotpo-highlight-author">Ingrida P.</span></li>     </ul>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-individual-reviews">     <h3>Reviews</h3>     <article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Rehana Q." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Stylish and Practical Suitcase</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"Lovely suitcase in a beautiful green colour. Stylish, lightweight and easy to manoeuvre. The wheels glide smoothly, and there’s plenty of space for packing. Very pleased with my purchase!"</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Rehana Q.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="stephen c." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Perfect cabin luggage</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"Really impressed with my Antler cabin luggage. It’s lightweight, stylish and feels really well made. Plenty of room inside without being bulky, and it fits perfectly as cabin luggage. The wheels are smooth and the case is easy to manoeuvre, which makes travelling so much easier.  Overall, a great quality case and excellent value for money. I’d definitely recommend Antler and would happily buy from them again. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">stephen c.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Jane D." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Perfect Size</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"I already have a large Antler suitcase which I use on foreign travel but I wanted a smaller one for girlie weekends away and this is perfect. It can fit several outfits for both day and evening and still has space for souvenirs on the journey home."</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Jane D.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="David K." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">travel in style</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"A fantastic suitcase, stylish, practical, and a joy to use!  A couple of years ago, I bought the same Antler suitcase in a lighter blue for my partner, and she has always loved using it whenever we travel. It’s such a pleasure to roll around, makes organising clothes easy and keeps everything neat and tidy. It’s also incredibly easy to clean after a trip.  I’ve now decided to match hers with the same suitcase in a darker blue, and I couldn’t be happier with the choice! Great design, excellent practicality, and a lovely way for us to travel in style together. Highly recommended!"</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">David K.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="James H." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Cool case - love it!</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"This cabin bag is so light, easy to wheel and manoeuvre. Perfect size for a weekend or short trip and a real upgrade on my old cabin case. Really love the colour as well!"</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">James H.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Kane R." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Effortless travel companion with a sleek, timeless design</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"The Antler Cabin Suitcase in Black with Single Stripe strikes the ideal balance between refined design and practical functionality. The signature single-stripe detail gives it a modern, elevated look, while the compact cabin dimensions easily satisfy airline hand-luggage requirements. Inside, the organizational compartments keep clothes secure and wrinkle-free, and the ultra-smooth spinner wheels make gliding through busy airport terminals effortless."</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Kane R.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Jacqui F." data-rating="4">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Get one - don't hesitate!</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"The Antler cabin bags are fantastic. Beautifully made, really easy to manoeuvre in any direction and very spacious inside. Fab range of colours too. And great value in the sale."</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Jacqui F.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">4/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Ellen H." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Brilliant and Stylish Cases</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"My second purchase with Antler and it’s safe to say these cases make you even more excited for a weekend trip or a long haul holiday. The colours stunning! Tested my first purchase in America and safe to say the wheels are a smooth ride, and peace of mind with how easy it is to set your security number too!"</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Ellen H.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Mrs W." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Anne White</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"The cabin bag is gorgeous and the finish is very high specification . I love the colour it is very feminine but not for my husband . The service from Antler is first class and the item arrived very well packaged . I would always buy from Antler if I require further luggage. It is encouraging that quality assurance still exists !"</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Mrs W.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Ash M." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Beautiful cabin case</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">"I’m really pleased with my Green Antler cabin suitcase. The green colour is stylish and easy to spot, and the suitcase feels well made while still being lightweight enough to carry comfortably. It’s a great size for cabin travel and has plenty of room for everything I need for a short trip.  The wheels roll smoothly, the handle feels sturdy, and the interior is well organised, making packing much easier. I’ve found it practical, smart-looking, and reliable for travelling.  Overall, I’m very happy with my purchase and would definitely recommend the Green Antler cabin suitcase to anyone looking for a stylish and practical cabin bag."</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">— <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Ash M.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-qa">     <h3>Q&amp;A</h3>     <dl>            </dl>   </section> </div>




