<p>Made with a durable polypropylene shell, Single Stripe protects your belongings while remaining lightweight and easy to handle. Its minimalist design is brought to life in bold, eye-catching colours, with custom wheels and a bespoke Antler handle for smooth, confident travel that brings a spirit of adventure and optimism to your travels.</p>
<p>With a spacious, organised interior – complete with fully recycled lining, packing straps, and a divider – the Single Stripe cabin is an accessible option for maximising hand-luggage allowance. The central stripe offers the perfect canvas for pairing with an Antler luggage strap, and can be playfully mixed and matched with other Antler collections for a travel ensemble that reflects your individual style.</p>
<p>Travelling for longer? Expand your packing possibilities with Single Stripe in Medium or Large, saving 15% when you create your bespoke luggage set.</p>
